        <title>Morning Song</title>
        <author>
            <name>Jujube</name>
        </author>
        <link href="https://www.jujubemonster.com/morning-song.html"/>
        <id>https://www.jujubemonster.com/morning-song.html</id>
        <media:content url="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/125/coldmoon-2.png" medium="image" />
            <category term="poetry"/>

        <updated>2026-08-16T08:36:18-07:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/125/coldmoon-2.png" alt="" />
                    Dawn had taken in the stars And left the faint white moon. O white moon, you are lonely, It is the same with me, But we have the world to roam over, Only the lonely are free. -- Sara Teasdale (1884-1933)
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/125/coldmoon-2.png" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p>Dawn had taken in the stars <br>And left the faint white moon. <br>O white moon, you are lonely, <br>It is the same with me, <br>But we have the world to roam over, <br>Only the lonely are free.</p>
<p>-- Sara Teasdale (1884-1933) </p>
<figure class="post__image"><img loading="lazy"  src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/125/coldmoon.png" alt="" width="500" height="664"></figure>
